@startuml xuanji-evolution-stages
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 20
skinparam dpi 300
scale 4
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam padding 8
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam BorderThickness 2
skinparam svgDimensionStyle false
skinparam svgLinkTarget _blank
' === 统一字号 16px（PlantUML 各元素字号参数默认值各异，不跟随 defaultFontSize） ===
skinparam titleFontSize 16
skinparam captionFontSize 16
skinparam noteFontSize 16
skinparam stereotypeFontSize 16
skinparam legendFontSize 16
skinparam packageTitleFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceGroupTitleFontSize 16
title Xuanji 三阶段演进路线（宪法 v1.2.0.1）

[*] --> Stage1

state "阶段 1 — Absorb（当前）" as Stage1 {
  state "主线产出：文档 + 外部参考资料整理" as s1a
  state "提案：ADR(Proposed) / Feature(Draft)" as s1b
  state "探索性试点：cmd/e2bgw、wasm 沙箱类" as s1c
}

state "阶段 2 — Fuse" as Stage2 {
  state "E2B 协议面 + Wasm 沙箱：试点 → 集成能力" as s2a
  state "允许重写 upstream 实现；\n改动文件强制登记 xuanji.md" as s2b
}

state "阶段 3 — Independent Delivery" as Stage3 {
  state "fork point：声明停止跟踪的 upstream commit" as s3a
  state "main 冻结为历史参考，独立演进" as s3b
}

Stage1 --> Stage2 : 退出：upstream 核心概念已被准确文档化\n改动可陈述「改了什么、为什么」
Stage2 --> Stage3 : 退出：能力已融合而非外挂\nrebase 成本可见地超过收益

note right of Stage3
  fork point 声明是宪法修正案：
  记录 upstream commit + 日期 + 理由；
  未声明前 Principle I 跟踪义务持续有效
end note

note left of Stage1
  两条全程约束：
  概念是临时的（不建兼容 shim）
  功能优先于打磨（机械门禁除外）
end note
@enduml
